SUMMARY:Craggy Gardens to Glassmine Overlook Fitness Hike - 10.4 Mi\, 2000
  Ft 
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nLots of folks from the Fitness Gro
 up are traveling this week so I am filling in to lead a hike. This is a 10
 .4 mile out and back starting at the Craggy Garden Visitors Center and goi
 ng along the MST to Glassmine Falls Overlook with about 2000 ft (Level 6) 
 of elevation gain. Some sections are rocky so keeping a fast pace can be t
 ough.\n\nhttps://www.alltrails.com/explore/custom-routes/uploaded-route-e1
 974dd\n\n**Pace**: Brisk pace overall average of 2.5 MPH on extended climb
 s and 3+ mph on lower grade and downhill sections\, briefly regrouping at 
 intersections and after longer strenuous climbs. **This is a strenuous hik
 e for conditioned hikers.** Be capable of hiking this distance and pace be
 fore signing on.\n\n**Carpool: 9:20 am** Meet at the Folk Arts Center park
 ing lot. Please indicate if you wish to carpool. and meeting place.\n\n**D
 ogs:** Trail friendly dogs are welcome.\n\n**HIKE LEVELS**\nLevel (1) Up t
 o 600 feet of elevation gain.\nLevel (2) 600'- 900'\; Level (3) 900' - 120
 0'\; Level (4) 1200' - 1500'\; Level (5) 1\,500' - 1\,800\\*\\*'\;\\*\\* L
 evel (6) 1\,800' - 2\,100'\; Level (7) 2\,100' **-** 2\,400'**\;** Level (
 8) 2\,400' - 2700'\, Level (9)\, Level (10) 3000' - 4000'\;\nULTIMATE HIKE
 S are >4000 feet in elevation.\n\n**Release of Liability:**:\nThe organize
 r of this trip is a volunteer and not a professional guide. The function o
 f the organizer is only to organize this trip. If you sign up or participa
 te in this event you acknowledge that you freely and voluntarily agree to 
 assume all risks of injuries\, illnesses and damages arising from\, as a r
 esult of and associated with this event. In addition\, you acknowledging t
 hat you agree to the Meetup terms: [https://www.meetup.com/terms](https://
 www.meetup.com/terms)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/314321210
 /
